{"month":"1977-02","articles":[],"events":[{"id":"h-276daf69faca1fad","date":"1977-02-02","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1976%E2%80%9377_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"주장 Geoff Nulty 가 이끄는 뉴캐슬 유나이티드 선수단은 Richard Dinnis 가 클럽의 상임 감독으로 임명되지 않는 한 파업하겠다고 위협했으며, 이사회가 Dinnis 또는 다른 선수들과상의하지 않고 Ralph Callachan을 영입하면서 마찰이 더욱 악화되었습니다. 그러나 그날 늦게 이사회는 선수들의 요구에 동의하고 Dinnis를 감독으로 임명했습니다.","titleTranslation":"machine","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":1},{"id":"h-f1212724ccc181cb","date":"1977-02-09","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1976%E2%80%9377_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"England lose at home for the first time for four years when they are beaten 2–0 by Holland at Wembley.","titleTranslation":"original","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-01620625f885449f","date":"1977-02-15","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1976%E2%80%9377_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"입스위치 타운 move to the top of the First Division with a 5–0 thrashing of 노리치 시티 in the East Anglia derby .","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-846ae96082ee1437","date":"1977-02-26","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1976%E2%80%9377_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"미들즈브러 dump 아스널 out of the FA Cup with a 4–1 win at Ayresome Park in the fifth round. 맨체스터 시티 lose 1–0 to 리즈 유나이티드 , and 맨체스터 유나이티드 draw 2–2 against 사우샘프턴 in a repeat of last year's final .","titleT